{"5088220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KRAVN", "steam_appid": 5088220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up underground. You don't know why you're alive. You don't know what happened up there. You just know something is very wrong down here, and you need to keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a room with a single stick sitting under a beam of light. It feels important. You pick it up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every alarm in the building goes off at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.poster.avif?t=1788281870\" width=1000 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.webm?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.mp4?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that stick is the only weapon you get, and it's all you need. Throw it and it ricochets off walls, ceilings, whatever's still standing, chaining through a room full of enemies before it even hits the ground. Add hitstop that makes every kill feel like it actually landed, plus a dash that never lets you stop moving, and combat turns into something closer to a puzzle you solve at full speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KRAVN is a fast, brutal boomer shooter set in the ruins of an underground war nobody survived to explain. You're heading deeper. Something else down here wants what's at the bottom too, and it isn't waiting around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit fast. Move faster. Don't stop to think about what these places used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.poster.avif?t=1788281870\" width=1000 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.webm?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.mp4?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet chain kills: turn one throw into a room-wide massacre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit has impact: hitstop makes each kill feel brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant momentum: dash forward, close the distance, never slow down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-era visuals: low-poly geometry, and a world that feels beautifully wrong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decaying artificial worlds: descend through enormous abandoned environments built during the war</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riff-driven metal: heavy, aggressive music built around the violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding: descend deeper, fight your way through, and discover what waits at the Core</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up underground. You don't know why you're alive. You don't know what happened up there. You just know something is very wrong down here, and you need to keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a room with a single stick sitting under a beam of light. It feels important. You pick it up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every alarm in the building goes off at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.poster.avif?t=1788281870\" width=1000 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.webm?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/ce2b82867c47037b0ccaca0e9a966b8d.mp4?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that stick is the only weapon you get, and it's all you need. Throw it and it ricochets off walls, ceilings, whatever's still standing, chaining through a room full of enemies before it even hits the ground. Add hitstop that makes every kill feel like it actually landed, plus a dash that never lets you stop moving, and combat turns into something closer to a puzzle you solve at full speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KRAVN is a fast, brutal boomer shooter set in the ruins of an underground war nobody survived to explain. You're heading deeper. Something else down here wants what's at the bottom too, and it isn't waiting around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit fast. Move faster. Don't stop to think about what these places used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.poster.avif?t=1788281870\" width=1000 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.webm?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/extras/881f561e41d737396cffa4776ca15810.mp4?t=1788281870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricochet chain kills: turn one throw into a room-wide massacre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit has impact: hitstop makes each kill feel brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant momentum: dash forward, close the distance, never slow down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-era visuals: low-poly geometry, and a world that feels beautifully wrong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decaying artificial worlds: descend through enormous abandoned environments built during the war</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riff-driven metal: heavy, aggressive music built around the violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding: descend deeper, fight your way through, and discover what waits at the Core</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "KRAVN is a PSX-style boomer shooter built around a living stick weapon: throw it, ricochet it off walls and enemies, chain kills fast. Fight your way down through humanity's last worlds, built deep to survive an AI war.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/cc2ced71fa89ec929d0d623f6c865bf33a4772a1/header.jpg?t=1788281870", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/2eb76239bbb34508f7813a54c3df8395dd4a353b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788281870", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088220/2eb76239bbb34508f7813a54c3df8395dd4a353b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788281870", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@arkinigames", "pc_requirements